  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hubei Yichang Rural Green Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project proposes a transformational approach to modernizing the agriculture sector in Yichang Municipality of Hubei Province in a green and sustainable manner through (i) strengthened institutions, knowledge, and research; (ii) increased value addition and efficiency in agribusiness and food supply chains; (iii) reduced climate and environmental impacts of agricultural activities; and (iv) improved resilience of rural infrastructures.</narrative>
  </description>
